{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHEN THE STARS FADE, THE MIND AWAKENS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Emir\u2019s plane crashed into the endless desert, it wasn\u2019t just the metal wings that broke. He woke up in a place neither of this world nor the afterlife. This is <strong>Barzakh</strong>; the thin veil between dreams and reality, the living and the dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this journey, you are not just trying to survive; you are repairing a fractured mind and seeking a way out in a limbo where memories are buried in the sand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/174f4adbd27574a4939badd568d17ec7.poster.avif?t=1768830172\" width=800 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/174f4adbd27574a4939badd568d17ec7.webm?t=1768830172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/174f4adbd27574a4939badd568d17ec7.mp4?t=1768830172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0c Explore Beyond the Veil</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barzakh is not a fixed place, but a reflection of Emir's inner world. Travel through universes where physics bend, gravity loses its meaning, and time stands still. From giants lurking in medieval darkness to ancient civilizations submerged underwater; every chapter holds a secret waiting to be unraveled.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf31 Cultivate Your Mind\u2019s Garden</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing you collect is just an &quot;item.&quot; Every star you find is a seed of truth.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover:</strong> Solve puzzles to reveal hidden stars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plant:</strong> Sow the stars into the barren garden of your mind (Hub World).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow:</strong> Create your own oasis in the middle of the void and confront Emir's past.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/9e8ed2a17950f39747cca2cb83cd34af.poster.avif?t=1768830172\" width=800 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/9e8ed2a17950f39747cca2cb83cd34af.webm?t=1768830172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/9e8ed2a17950f39747cca2cb83cd34af.mp4?t=1768830172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f The Power of Words</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every universe has its own &quot;Word.&quot; Stars bring you not only light but also the missing sentences of the story. Combine these words to understand why Emir is here and rewrite his fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 In the Footsteps of Sufism &amp; The Little Prince</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combining the naivety of <i>The Little Prince</i> with the depth of Sufi philosophy, <strong>Barzakh: The Star Gardener</strong> offers a non-violent, atmospheric, and meditative experience akin to <i>Journey</i> and <i>GRIS</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/5e7f93c17ce16f2b180db04898f2695a.poster.avif?t=1768830172\" width=800 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/5e7f93c17ce16f2b180db04898f2695a.webm?t=1768830172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/5e7f93c17ce16f2b180db04898f2695a.mp4?t=1768830172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEAVE YOUR MARK IN THE SANDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I may be developing Barzakh alone, but we are writing this story together. I share the entire development process, behind-the-scenes footage, and new ideas on our <strong>Discord</strong> server.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My Promise to You:</strong> If you join our community and contribute to the world of Barzakh with your feedback, you will live forever within the game. I will hide my most creative supporters into the game\u2019s very texture;</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps your name in a dusty <strong>book</strong> in the library,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your portrait on an old <strong>photograph</strong> on a wall,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or your story within an examinable, <strong>special artifact</strong> buried under the sands.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come, become an &quot;Easter Egg&quot; in this universe and leave your own trace in the void.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3849950?t=1768830172","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/6dfdd40b9ddf616bc267fcea557565a3ffcd3d8f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768830172","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/6313a6898ba411e04cb40f35482b6fc301e24692/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768830172","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/6313a6898ba411e04cb40f35482b6fc301e24692/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768830172","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHEN THE STARS FADE, THE MIND AWAKENS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Emir\u2019s plane crashed into the endless desert, it wasn\u2019t just the metal wings that broke. He woke up in a place neither of this world nor the afterlife. This is <strong>Barzakh</strong>; the thin veil between dreams and reality, the living and the dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this journey, you are not just trying to survive; you are repairing a fractured mind and seeking a way out in a limbo where memories are buried in the sand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/174f4adbd27574a4939badd568d17ec7.poster.avif?t=1768830172\" width=800 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/174f4adbd27574a4939badd568d17ec7.webm?t=1768830172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/174f4adbd27574a4939badd568d17ec7.mp4?t=1768830172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0c Explore Beyond the Veil</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barzakh is not a fixed place, but a reflection of Emir'