<i>The Little Prince</i> with the depth of Sufi philosophy, <strong>Barzakh: The Star Gardener</strong> offers a non-violent, atmospheric, and meditative experience akin to <i>Journey</i> and <i>GRIS</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/5e7f93c17ce16f2b180db04898f2695a.poster.avif?t=1768830172\" width=800 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/5e7f93c17ce16f2b180db04898f2695a.webm?t=1768830172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849950/extras/5e7f93c17ce16f2b180db04898f2695a.mp4?t=1768830172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LEAVE YOUR MARK IN THE SANDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I may be developing Barzakh alone, but we are writing this story together. I share the entire development process, behind-the-scenes footage, and new ideas on our <strong>Discord</strong> server.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My Promise to You:</strong> If you join our community and contribute to the world of Barzakh with your feedback, you will live forever within the game. I will hide my most creative supporters into the game\u2019s very texture;</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps your name in a dusty <strong>book</strong> in the library,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your portrait on an old <strong>photograph</strong> on a wall,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or your story within an examinable, <strong>special artifact</strong> buried under the sands.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come, become an &quot;Easter Egg&quot; in this universe and leave your own trace in the void.</p>","developers":["Emirhan G\u00fcng\u00f6rmez"],"genres":[{